message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository and cite the original dataset and MiniRocket separately."
title: "MIRA-CSI: Missingness-Informed Recognition of Activities from Wi-Fi CSI"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/ABDESSAMAD-BOURKIBATE/mira-csi"
url: "https://github.com/ABDESSAMAD-BOURKIBATE/mira-csi"
authors:
  - family-names: Bourkibate
    given-names: Abdessamad
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6186-8071"
abstract: "Research implementation and reproducible reliability evaluation for missingness-informed Wi-Fi CSI activity recognition. The original 60-fit comparison, a separate frozen 90-fit component/residual-control follow-up, numerical summaries, and an unreviewed author manuscript accompany the software. Evidence is conditional and does not establish broad model superiority."
